    {
      "source_id": "id03919",
      "verdict": "CORRECTED",
      "reason": "The original calque 'не мешает тому, что' was clumsy and unclear. 'Cela n'empêche pas que' means 'that doesn't change the fact', so I rendered it idiomatically and kept the hearsay ('à ce que j'ai entendu dire')."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "id03920",
      "verdict": "CORRECTED",
      "reason": "'Le fait est que' means 'it is true that' (a concession), not 'the point is that'. Corrected."
    },
    {
