      "reason": "Faithful; the day/night wordplay is preserved."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "id03922",
      "verdict": "CORRECTED",
      "reason": "'C'est-à-dire la nuit' answers the 'jour' of the question, so the noun 'ночь' keeps the quip, instead of the adjective 'ночной' left dangling."
    },
    {
